summary: Go unit tests, including the race detector
description: |
    Runs the whole Go test suite from the source tree on a real Fedora/EL
    machine. The RPM build does not run tests: build chroots lack tools the
    tests may use and give no useful logs when they fail.
test: ./test.sh
duration: 20m
require:
  - golang
  - gcc
  - git
